egies, and global compliance standards protecting modern digital infrastructure. Telecommunications & Connectivity: Providing expert analysis on next-generation networks, including the global rollout of 5G-Advanced, early 6G research, Low Earth Orbit (LEO) satellite internet, Open RAN, and the fiber-optic backbone of the digital econom1-10ke
